# Design Spec — Queue List Home

**Screen:** Queue List Home
**Type:** New Screen
**Platforms:** Desktop Web

## Description

The Queue List Home is the first screen a user sees after logging in. It displays the default video queue.


## UI Elements

### Header (sticky)
- Left: QueueTube logo (wordmark);
- Right: search icon + user avatar;
- Figma Component Design: https://www.figma.com/design/eAP0G94LO7SHwymq1Dw8wI/QueueTube---Design-Kit?node-id=13664-51&t=BmWjotA8V51Ff2g9-0;

### Body
- Section heading: "Queue Name"
- **Queue Card List**:
  - Each card contains:
    - Thumbnail (16:9, auto-generated gradient if no custom image);
    - The Video Title
    - Beneath the Title, the Creator and then, the View amount;
    - Three-dot overflow menu icon (visible on hover/focus);
    - Figma Content: https://www.figma.com/design/eAP0G94LO7SHwymq1Dw8wI/QueueTube---Design-Kit?node-id=13658-236&t=BmWjotA8V51Ff2g9-0

### Loading State
- Skeleton animation cards matching the queue list layout;
- Figma Content: https://www.figma.com/design/eAP0G94LO7SHwymq1Dw8wI/QueueTube---Design-Kit?node-id=13614-2657&t=BmWjotA8V51Ff2g9-0;

### Empty State
- Heading: "No Tube yet";
- Subtext: "Paste YouTube link to queue the video.";
- Figma Content: https://www.figma.com/design/eAP0G94LO7SHwymq1Dw8wI/QueueTube---Design-Kit?node-id=13658-11&t=BmWjotA8V51Ff2g9-0;

## Acceptance Criteria

- [x] Desktop layout (https://www.figma.com/design/eAP0G94LO7SHwymq1Dw8wI/QueueTube---Design-Kit?node-id=13658-234&t=BmWjotA8V51Ff2g9-0)
- [x] Empty state visible when queue list returns 0 items
- [x] All interactive states (hover, loading, empty, overflow menu) documented
